		(uuid "a1c1acca-37cd-5c98-a21b-8dfa738f0bd9")
	)
	(text "Supplies per DS11929 Fig. 16: VDD n x 100 nF + 4.7 uF (C401-C404); VDDA 10 nF + 1 uF (C405, C406);\nVDDRF 100 nF + 100 pF (C407, C408); VDDSMPS 4.7 uF (C409); VFBSMPS 4.7 uF (C410); VBAT, VDDUSB on +3V3.\nSMPS at 8 MHz: 2.2 uH (Table 6) plus the 10 nH series inductor of its note 2 (LQG15WZ10NJ02D).\nAT0/AT1 reserved, kept unconnected (pin table note 7). BOOT0 pulled down: boot from flash.\nHSE: NX2016SA 32 MHz (Table 5), load caps on-chip (HSETUNE); ASSUMPTION: CS06465 (CL 10 pF), not CS06654.\nLSE: FC-135, CL 12.5 pF: C = 2 (CL - Cstray) = 18 pF (derived; Cstray 3.5 pF ASSUMPTION).\nNRST 100 nF (ASSUMPTION: ST's usual value; internal pull-up)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 257.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a45af096-4ed3-541f-b958-e0b6cd812213")
	)
